<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Elan and Eli Lilly extend research agreement.</title>
<headline>Elan and Eli Lilly extend research agreement.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elan Corporation's  wholly-owned subsidiary, Athena Neurosciences Inc., and Eli Lilly and Co on Tuesday agreed to extend research collaboration in the field of Alzheimer's disease to August, 1998.</p>
</text>
